# oneloopsol.com
# Created in cooperation with ChatGPT
# Unedited by me
#
# Intent is a brand independent script for laptops with keyboard backlight
# Turns off the backlight after 60 seconds (parameter in script),
# and automatically back on, on any keypress
#
# Not tested that much, but it works for me

# Usage:

chmod +x auto-kbd-backlight
./auto-kbd-backlight
